# ~/seo-pages IS the published artifact: the Cloudflare Pages project
# `seo-landing-pages` is a direct upload of this directory, and the daily
# runner (seo-pipeline-runner.sh) does `git add -A`. So anything committed
# here becomes a live URL, and the sitemap generator walks the directory.
#
# Keep scratch, quarantine and tool state out of the tree.
#
# Deliberately NOT listed here yet, because tracked copies already exist and a
# .gitignore that matches them could silently drop currently-published files
# from the next whole-directory upload (see card t_0e949206 §6):
#   .wrangler/     24 tracked files (findaiagency.com/.wrangler/cache/*, ...)
#   *.bak-*         3 tracked files (idle-sites/ai-agency-pricing-calculator/*)
# Cleaning those up is its own card.

.rejected/
.quarantine/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*~
node_modules/
